=====================================================
This project is a fan remake of the Flash game "Turbocharged
Penguins" (released October 2006, distributed via Optus Pre-Paid).
The following material was extracted from that original game, and
all rights remain with their original owners:

    assets/f-art.js      vector artwork exported from the original SWF
    assets/audio/        all .mp3 / .wav sound files
    index.html           embeds the above in base64 form

The name "Turbocharged Penguins" and the character artwork are used
solely to identify the original work being preserved. This project
is not affiliated with or endorsed by the original rights holders.
The material is included for non-commercial archival and educational
purposes as part of Flash-game preservation.

If you hold rights to any of this material and would like it removed,
please contact lingyicute@gmail.com — it will be removed promptly.
